'''The Draugur's Lantern''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Ancient Spirit Shield}}.

==Mechanics==
Draugurflames burn enemies within 3 metres [[distance]] of the shield's wearer, dealing Fire damage over time equal to 15% of the Damage per second of the strongest Ignite you've inflicted in the past 8 seconds. The damage of this burn cannot be directly modified.

